#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/bsdinstall/_index.adoc:484
#, fuzzy
msgid "bsdinstall gives the user four methods for allocating disk space:"
msgstr "bsdinstall 提供四种分配磁盘空间的方法："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/bsdinstall/_index.adoc:486
#, fuzzy
