"installation."
msgstr "bsdinstall 会提示是否需要在重启进入新系统之前进行其他配置。选择 btn:[Yes] 可进入新系统中的 shell，或选择 btn:[No] 继续安装的最后一步。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/bsdinstall/_index.adoc:1180
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete the Installation"
msgstr "完成安装"

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/bsdinstall/_index.adoc:1181
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
